    <node id="src.intellicrack.__init__">
      <data key="d0">module</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d2">D:\Intellicrack\src\intellicrack\__init__.py</data>
      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.__init__</data>
      <data key="d4">Intellicrack: AI-powered reverse engineering orchestration platform.

This package provides a unified interface for controlling reverse engineering tools
(Ghidra, x64dbg, Frida, Cutter/Rizin) through natural language AI interaction.

The architecture consists of:
    - Core: Configuration, logging, types, session management, orchestration
    - Providers: LLM provider implementations (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Ollama, OpenRouter)
    - Bridges: Tool integrations (Ghidra, x64dbg, Frida, Cutter/R...</data>
    </node>
