      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">__getattr__</data>
      <data key="d5">['name']</data>
      <data key="d4">Lazy import for main components.

This allows importing frequently used components directly from
the intellicrack namespace without loading all dependencies upfront.

Args:
    name: The name of the attribute to retrieve.

Returns:
    object: The requested module attribute.

Raises:
    AttributeError: If the attribute is not found.</data>
    </node>
