    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.tools">
      <data key="d0">module</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d2">D:\Intellicrack\src\intellicrack\core\tools.py</data>
      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.core.tools</data>
      <data key="d4">Tool registry for managing tool bridges.

This module provides a registry for tool bridges that handles
initialization, availability checking, and tool schema generation
for LLM function calling.

Bridge imports are deferred to method bodies to break a circular
dependency: bridges.base -&gt; core.logging -&gt; core.__init__ -&gt; core.tools
-&gt; bridges.binary -&gt; bridges.base.</data>
    </node>
