    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.orchestrator.process_user_input">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">process_user_input</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'text']</data>
      <data key="d4">Process user input and generate response.

This is the main agent loop:
1. Add user message to session
2. Send to LLM with tool definitions
3. If LLM returns tool calls, execute them
4. Send tool results back to LLM
5. Repeat until LLM returns final text response
6. Add assistant message to session

Args:
    text: User's natural language input.

Raises:
    RuntimeError: If no active session.</data>
    </node>
