    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.process_manager.check_running">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">check_running</data>
      <data key="d5">['self']</data>
      <data key="d4">Check if process is still running (non-cached version).

This method exists to avoid mypy's type narrowing on property access.
Use this when checking running state after an operation that may have
changed the process state.

Returns:
    bool: True if the process is still running, False otherwise.</data>
    </node>
