    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.transform_pipeline.TransformPipeline">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">TransformPipeline</data>
      <data key="d4">Ordered chain of binary transform operations.

Steps execute in insertion order, each receiving the output of the
previous step as its input. The pipeline accumulates steps via
``add_step`` and executes them via ``execute`` or ``preview``.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.transform_pipeline.get_all_transform_nodes">
