    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.yara_scanner.YaraScanner">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">YaraScanner</data>
      <data key="d4">Thread-safe YARA rule scanner with async support.

Compilation is not thread-safe; scanning compiled rules objects is.
Use separate ``YaraScanner`` instances or external locking when compiling
concurrently.

Args:
    timeout: Maximum seconds allowed per match operation before
        a ``TimeoutError`` is raised by the YARA engine.</data>
    </node>
