    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.hexpat.data_reader.DataReader">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">DataReader</data>
      <data key="d4">Provides typed byte access to binary data for pattern evaluation.

Wraps either a HexDocument PyO3 object or raw bytes behind a uniform
read interface used by the HexPat evaluator.

Args:
    read_fn: A callable ``(offset, length) -&gt; bytes`` that returns
        the requested byte slice from the underlying data source.
    length: Total number of bytes available in the data source.</data>
    </node>
