    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.core.hexpat.pattern_registry.match_file">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">match_file</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'data_reader']</data>
      <data key="d4">Find patterns whose magic bytes match the given binary data.

Reads the first 1024 bytes and checks each indexed pattern's
magic_bytes against the data.

Args:
    data_reader: DataReader wrapping the binary data to match.

Returns:
    list[PatternMetadata]: A list of matching PatternMetadata, sorted by specificity
    (longer magic sequences first).</data>
    </node>
