      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.core.hexpat.stdlib</data>
      <data key="d4">Python implementations of builtin:: namespace functions.

The standard library .pat files define public APIs (std::mem, std::string,
etc.) that internally call low-level builtin:: functions. This module provides
those builtin:: implementations backed by DataReader for binary access.</data>
