    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.highlighter._highlight_triple_quotes">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_highlight_triple_quotes</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'text']</data>
      <data key="d4">Handle multi-line triple-quoted string highlighting.

Uses QSyntaxHighlighter block state to track whether we are
inside a triple-quoted string across lines.

State encoding:
    -1 or 0: not inside a triple-quoted string
    1: inside a double-triple-quote block
    2: inside a single-triple-quote block

Args:
    text: The text block to highlight.</data>
