      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.ui.sandbox_config</data>
      <data key="d4">Sandbox configuration dialog for Intellicrack.

This module provides the UI for configuring Windows Sandbox settings, including isolation options, resource limits, and execution policies.</data>
