    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.resources" />
    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.sandbox_config.SandboxTestWorker">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">SandboxTestWorker</data>
      <data key="d4">Worker thread for testing Windows Sandbox.

Launches Windows Sandbox with a test configuration and monitors
its execution without blocking the UI.

Args:
    network_enabled: Whether networking is enabled.
