      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.ui.panels.async_bridge</data>
      <data key="d4">Shared async-to-sync bridge runner for Qt UI panels.

Provides a coroutine runner that safely executes async bridge methods from synchronous Qt slots, using a persistent background event loop
thread to preserve asyncio primitives across calls. Includes both blocking and non-blocking variants for different use cases.</data>
