    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.frida_panel">
      <data key="d0">module</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d2">D:\Intellicrack\src\intellicrack\ui\panels\frida_panel.py</data>
      <data key="d3">src.intellicrack.ui.panels.frida_panel</data>
      <data key="d4">Frida instrumentation panel for Intellicrack.

Provides a script editor, console output, and hook manager for interacting with Frida dynamic instrumentation framework.</data>
    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.frida_panel.FridaPanel">
      <data key="d0">class</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">FridaPanel</data>
      <data key="d4">Panel for Frida dynamic instrumentation and hooking.

Provides a script editor for writing Frida JavaScript,
a console for viewing output, and a hook manager table
for managing active function hooks.

Args:
    parent: Parent widget.

Attributes:
    hook_added: Signal emitted with hook ID when a Frida hook is registered.
    script_executed: Signal emitted when a Frida script finishes execution.</data>
    </node>
