    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.hex_tools_panel._set_hint">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_set_hint</data>
      <data key="d5">['widget', 'text']</data>
      <data key="d4">Set the greyed-out hint text shown when a widget is empty.

Locates the setter method via ``getattr`` to keep the method name
out of the source literal.

