    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.hex_tools_panel._do_calculate">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_do_calculate</data>
      <data key="d5">['self']</data>
      <data key="d4">Evaluate all expressions in the calculator input and show results.

Each non-empty line is parsed with the ``ast`` module and evaluated
through a whitelist-based AST visitor that permits only numeric
literals, arithmetic, and bitwise operations.  Results are shown as
``expression = result``.</data>
