      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_split_at_offset</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'data', 'offset', 'outdir', 'src_path']</data>
      <data key="d4">Split file data into two parts at the given byte offset.

Args:
    data: The complete file contents.
