    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.hex_tools_panel._split_into_chunks">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_split_into_chunks</data>
      <data key="d5">['self', 'data', 'chunk_size', 'outdir', 'src_path']</data>
      <data key="d4">Split file data into equal-size chunks with a possible remainder.

Args:
    data: The complete file contents.
    chunk_size: Maximum number of bytes per chunk.
    outdir: Directory to write the output parts into.
    src_path: Original source file path (used for naming).</data>
    </node>
    <node id="src.intellicrack.ui.panels.hex_tools_panel._do_split_file">
      <data key="d0">function</data>
      <data key="d1">python</data>
      <data key="d3">_do_split_file</data>
      <data key="d5">['self']</data>
      <data key="d4">Split the selected source file according to the chosen mode and value.

In offset mode, splits into two files at the specified byte offset.
In chunk mode, splits into multiple equal-size parts with a final
remainder chunk if the file size is not evenly divisible.</data>
    </node>
